## 📊 Performance & Memory Benchmark Summary

| Metric | Handling 1 Candidate | Handling 200+ Candidates | Scaling Mechanism |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **S3 Session Listing** | ~60ms | ~65ms | Prefix isolation (`Prefix="simulation_training/{user_id}/"`) |
| **ChromaDB Vector Retrieval** | ~15ms | ~20ms | Indexed metadata filtering (`where={"user_id": user_id}`) |
| **Candidate Name Lookup** | In-memory lookup | In-memory lookup (~1ms) | Cached Candidate Index (`data/candidate_cache.json`) |
| **Storage Overhead** | Minimal | ~50 KB cache file | Single lightweight metadata cache file |
